# skill-shot window: P1, launch, a_spot4 collision in mode 10 -> mode 2, targets_hit 1 (MissionControl pre-hook),
# jackpot +50,000 in that frame. The ball is held out of play in the plunger lane so no natural contact precedes the event.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init dump_period 10
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
150 expect mode == 10
200 event a_spot4 ControlCollision
201 expect mode == 2
201 expect targets_hit == 1
201 expect jackpot == 50000 delta 199
201 expect ball_held == 0
300 quit
